    "markdown": "---\npagetitle: \"DigiKat — Katolički medijski opservatorij\"\npage-layout: custom\ntoc: false\n---\n\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n```{=html}\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #1b1d21; line-height: 1.55;\">\n\n<!-- ============ HERO ============ -->\n<section style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e2da;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 72px 40px 64px;\">\n    <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #0f4c5c; margin-bottom: 26px;\">\n      <span style=\"width: 7px; height: 7px; background: #0f4c5c; border-radius: 50%;\"></span>\n      <a href=\"https://www.lukasikic.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #0f4c5c; text-decoration: none;\">Luka Šikić</a>\n      · Hrvatsko katoličko sveučilište · 2021.–2027.\n    </div>\n    <h1 style=\"font-family: 'Source Serif 4', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 52px; line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -0.015em; margin: 0; max-width: 19ch; color: #14181d; text-wrap: balance;\">\n      Katolički medijski opservatorij\n    </h1>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; color: #4f535a; margin: 22px 0 0; max-width: 60ch;\">\n      Tko u Hrvatskoj objavljuje o katoličkim temama? Što od toga doista odjekne? Kada pažnja raste? Odgovore računamo iz 413.985 medijskih objava s portala, društvenih mreža i foruma, prikupljenih od 2021. godine. Mape pokazuju kako taj prostor izgleda u cjelini, istraživačima je cijela baza otvorena za vlastite analize, a svako uredništvo može provjeriti kako njegov medij stoji.\n    </p>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; margin-top: 38px;\">\n      <a href=\"pages/mapa/index.html\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; background: #0f4c5c; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: 6px;\">Mapa medijskog prostora</a>\n      <a href=\"pages/baza.html\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; background: transparent; color: #14181d; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #cfccc2;\">Istraži podatke</a>\n      <a href=\"pages/moj-medij.html\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; background: transparent; color: #14181d; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #cfccc2;\">Pronađite svoj medij</a>\n      <a href=\"assets/izvjestaji/godisnji-pregled-2025.html\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; background: transparent; color: #14181d; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #cfccc2;\">Godišnji pregled 2025.</a>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-top: 14px; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #6b6f76;\">\n      Godišnji pregled dostupan je za <a href=\"assets/izvjestaji/godisnji-pregled-2025.pdf\" style=\"color: #0f4c5c;\">preuzimanje i ispis (PDF)</a> te u engleskom izdanju kao <a href=\"assets/izvjestaji/annual-review-2025.html\" style=\"color: #0f4c5c;\">HTML</a> i <a href=\"assets/izvjestaji/annual-review-2025.pdf\" style=\"color: #0f4c5c;\">PDF</a>.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ READER PATHS ============ -->\n<section style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e2da; background: #fff;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 56px 40px 60px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #0f4c5c; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Odaberite svoje polazište</div>\n    <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Source Serif 4', serif; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 600; color: #14181d; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Što želite saznati?</h2>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 17px; color: #4f535a; max-width: 66ch; margin: 0 0 28px;\">Isti se podaci mogu čitati iz uredničke, istraživačke i javne perspektive. Svaki put vodi izravno na otvorene rezultate projekta.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 18px;\">\n      <article style=\"border: 1px solid #e4e2da; border-radius: 10px; padding: 24px; background: #f9f8f5;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #0f4c5c; margin-bottom: 10px;\">Vodim medij</div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">Kako moj medij stoji?</h3>\n        <p style=\"color: #4f535a;\">Pronađite svoj izvor, pregledajte volumen, zabilježene interakcije i doseg te preuzmite sažetak za dijeljenje.</p>\n        <a href=\"pages/moj-medij.html\" style=\"color: #0f4c5c; font-weight: 600;\">Otvorite Moj medij</a>\n      </article>\n      <article style=\"border: 1px solid #e4e2da; border-radius: 10px; padding: 24px; background: #f9f8f5;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #0f4c5c; margin-bottom: 10px;\">Istražujem medije</div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">Kako mogu provjeriti nalaze?</h3>\n        <p style=\"color: #4f535a;\">Otvorite bazu, metodologiju, kod i tematska istraživanja. Svaki javni agregat može se ponovno izračunati.</p>\n        <a href=\"pages/baza.html\" style=\"color: #0f4c5c; font-weight: 600;\">Otvorite bazu podataka</a>\n      </article>\n      <article style=\"border: 1px solid #e4e2da; border-radius: 10px; padding: 24px; background: #f9f8f5;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #0f4c5c; margin-bottom: 10px;\">Pratim medijski prostor</div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">Što je obilježilo godinu?</h3>\n        <p style=\"color: #4f535a;\">Počnite godišnjim pregledom, a zatim otvorite mape ekosustava, tema, diskursa i događaja.</p>\n        <a href=\"assets/izvjestaji/godisnji-pregled-2025.html\" style=\"color: #0f4c5c; font-weight: 600;\">Otvorite godišnji pregled</a>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ STATS BAND ============ -->\n<section style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e2da;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 52px 40px;\">\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr); gap: 0; align-items: start;\">\n      <div style=\"padding: 4px 28px 4px 0; border-right: 1px solid #e4e2da;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-weight: 600; font-size: 36px; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #14181d;\">413.985</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #6b6f76; margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.4;\">medijskih objava</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding: 4px 28px; border-right: 1px solid #e4e2da;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-weight: 600; font-size: 36px; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #14181d;\">54</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #6b6f76; margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.4;\">stupca u korpusu</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding: 4px 28px; border-right: 1px solid #e4e2da;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-weight: 600; font-size: 36px; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #14181d;\">6</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #6b6f76; margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.4;\">kalendarskih godina · 2021.–2026.</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding: 4px 28px; border-right: 1px solid #e4e2da;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-weight: 600; font-size: 36px; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #14181d;\">9</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #6b6f76; margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.4;\">vrsta izvora i platformi</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding: 4px 28px; border-right: 1px solid #e4e2da;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-weight: 600; font-size: 36px; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #14181d;\">16</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #6b6f76; margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.4;\">tematskih kategorija</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding: 4px 0 4px 28px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-weight: 600; font-size: 36px; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #14181d;\">4</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #6b6f76; margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.4;\">analitičke razine</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 28px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid #e4e2da; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 11.5px; color: #4f535a;\">\n      <span style=\"background: #f2f0ea; border-radius: 4px; padding: 4px 10px;\">Web portali</span>\n      <span style=\"background: #f2f0ea; border-radius: 4px; padding: 4px 10px;\">Facebook</span>\n      <span style=\"background: #f2f0ea; border-radius: 4px; padding: 4px 10px;\">YouTube</span>\n      <span style=\"background: #f2f0ea; border-radius: 4px; padding: 4px 10px;\">Reddit</span>\n      <span style=\"background: #f2f0ea; border-radius: 4px; padding: 4px 10px;\">Twitter / X</span>\n      <span style=\"background: #f2f0ea; border-radius: 4px; padding: 4px 10px;\">Forumi</span>\n      <span style=\"background: #f2f0ea; border-radius: 4px; padding: 4px 10px;\">Instagram</span>\n      <span style=\"background: #f2f0ea; border-radius: 4px; padding: 4px 10px;\">Komentari</span>\n      <span style=\"background: #f2f0ea; border-radius: 4px; padding: 4px 10px;\">TikTok</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<section class=\"home-network\">\n<div class=\"hn-inner\">\n<div class=\"hn-text\">\n  <h2>Mreža izvora</h2>\n  <p>Iza brojki stoje konkretni akteri. <strong>Mreža izvora</strong> prikazuje objavljene profile iz <strong>Kataloga izvora</strong> kao interaktivni graf. Svaki je čvor jedan izvor, obojen prema platformi i skaliran prema volumenu objava iz službenog korpusa.</p>\n  <p>Korpus obuhvaća devet vrsta izvora i platformi, dok katalog donosi profile aktera za šest platformi s usporedivim agregatima: web, YouTube, Facebook, Instagram, TikTok i Twitter.</p>\n  <p>Poveznice su strukturne: pripadnost platformi te zajednički brend ili osoba prisutna na više platformi. Graf je interaktivan — čvorove možete povlačiti i zumirati, a prelaskom preko čvora otkrivaju se tipologija, volumen, angažman i doseg.</p>\n  <div class=\"hn-links\">\n    <a class=\"hn-primary\" href=\"pages/izvori/mreza.html\">Istraži mrežu</a>\n    <a class=\"hn-ghost\" href=\"pages/izvori/index.html\">Katalog izvora</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hn-viz\">\n```\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"htmlwidget-415d7f1fe8c9cf91379b\" style=\"width:100%;height:460px;\" class=\"visNetwork html-widget\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-415d7f1fe8c9cf91379b\">{\"x\":{\"nodes\":{\"id\":[\"HUB::web\",\"HUB::youtube\",\"HUB::facebook\",\"HUB::instagram\",\"HUB::tiktok\",\"HUB::twitter\",\"web::novizivot.net\",\"web::hkm.hr\",\"web::dnevno.hr\",\"web::index.hr\",\"web::24sata.hr\",\"web::vecernji.hr\",\"web::slobodnadalmacija.hr\",\"web::bitno.net\",\"web::jutarnji.hr\",\"web::laudato.hr\",\"web::telegram.hr\",\"web::dnevnik.hr\",\"web::caritas.hr\",\"web::net.hr\",\"web::narod.hr\",\"web::dalmatinskiportal.hr\",\"youtube::pulherissimus\",\"youtube::Pod Smokvom\",\"youtube::Majko Marijo\",\"youtube::Hrana za dušu\",\"youtube::BOŽANSKA LJUBAV\",\"youtube::LaudatoTV\",\"youtube::budiFRAjer\",\"youtube::Stopama Padre Pija\",\"youtube::Nova Eva\",\"youtube::Bog Je Tu\",\"youtube::Dijete